  "description": "*\"If I had a brother, my family wouldn't have ended up like this!\"*\n\nOh Won-Seok, a timid but kind-hearted otaku boy. His family has been falling apart day by day since his brother's accident 10 years ago. Won-Seok, who didn't give in to school violence and endured each day with his favorite character, Airi-Jing, is sent to his grandmother's house to avoid the eyes of loan sharks. Left alone, Won-Seok hears a mysterious voice and follows the voice to find a talking skateboard?!! The meeting of a talking skateboard and an otaku boy! What kind of events await them ahead?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
